ngine/godot-proposals/issues/14636\r\n\r\nThis PR adds two new toggles to `TabBar` (& `TabContainer`):\r\n1. `hide_titles` (& `hide_tabs_titles`): Hides the titles on all tabs from displaying\r\n2. `hide_icons` (& `hide_tabs_icons`): Hides the icons on all tabs from displaying\r\n\r\nBelow is a summary table (uses a mockup of the editor title bar)\r\n\r\n| -- | Horizontal |\r\n| -- | -- |\r\n| show both (default) | <img width=\"417\" height=\"71\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6f0989be-d471-4adb-8cff-85dd8c9ee246\" /> |\r\n| hide titles | <img width=\"195\" height=\"59\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee6a0db8-9aee-40a6-bf6a-ec15d823b803\" /> |\r\n| hide icons | <img width=\"308\" height=\"59\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb4a421c-3f8c-4681-8118-cb89a86ad658\" /> |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://